# Council verdict REJECT
# Bill SHA-256:
# 4295e790fd8f4e96e17fd54e033c4004bce7ed18aafc5a6c5bbda8d6f4931916
#
# No environment variable is required for compilation, tests, or local
# simulation. Hardhat does not load .env, declare a remote network, or accept a
# private signer. Packaged Sepolia/Base Sepolia deployment, upgrade, mock-token,
# and legacy smoke commands fail before environment or network access.
#
# Read-only provenance CLIs document their optional public RPC input separately
# and never use a wallet or signer. Do not place credentials or private keys in
# this file.
